1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 11=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:42,840
If I

7
00:01:43,710 --> 00:01:45,200
delay Xiuwan's marriage,

8
00:01:46,310 --> 00:01:49,430
Mother and I
will both feel terrible about it.

9
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:01,510
Invite the Xie family to see
the flowers on the Festival of Man.

10
00:02:05,928 --> 00:02:08,216
The plum blossoms in the courtyard
have already withered.

11
00:02:08,392 --> 00:02:09,752
Why not admire paintings instead?

12
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,520
Don't get any ideas about my paintings.

13
00:02:14,430 --> 00:02:16,870
It wouldn't be proper
to invite only the Xie family.

14
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,710
You and Jinqiao
can send out invitations together.

15
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,590
Invite all the young men

16
00:02:21,590 --> 00:02:24,710
around your age
who share your interests.

17
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:26,190
Let's make it a lively gathering.

18
00:02:27,910 --> 00:02:30,400
Mother plans to find matches
this year for Cuique and Xiuru.

19
00:02:31,030 --> 00:02:33,240
She must be happy.

20
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:36,400
Oh, right.

21
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:39,710
Don't forget the invitation
for the Zhao family.

22
00:02:39,710 --> 00:02:41,240
Whether they come is up to them.

23
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:44,080
But we must observe proper etiquette.

24
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:50,180
(Festival of Man)
Is this straight now?

25
00:02:50,190 --> 00:02:51,720
Raise the left side a little higher.

26
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:52,800
Good.

27
00:02:53,150 --> 00:02:53,840
How about now?

28
00:02:54,030 --> 00:02:55,520
A little to the right. A little more.

29
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,190
Slowly.

30
00:02:56,408 --> 00:02:57,750
Clean everything more thoroughly.

31
00:02:57,848 --> 00:02:58,968
Make sure it's spotless.

32
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:01,080
Careful. Put it here. Right here.

33
00:03:01,090 --> 00:03:03,390
- First Madam. Second Madam.
- First Madam. Second Madam.

34
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:05,110
- First Madam. Second Madam.
- First Madam. Second Madam.

35
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:07,180
Come help once you've
finished wiping the doorframe.

36
00:03:07,190 --> 00:03:07,840
Yes.

37
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:13,710
That's about right.

38
00:03:16,808 --> 00:03:18,840
You certainly know
how to handle things, Shunhua.

39
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:21,470
Otherwise, Old Master
would never have agreed.

40
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,360
Just think about it.

41
00:03:25,370 --> 00:03:27,680
Young Lady Zhao was the one
who did something disgraceful,

42
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,832
yet we're the ones
who have to swallow our anger.

43
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:33,470
Old Madam and Jinlan
still don't know about it.

44
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,160
If you keep talking like this,

45
00:03:35,630 --> 00:03:37,710
I won't dare confide in you again.

46
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,030
I was wrong.

47
00:03:39,310 --> 00:03:41,120
I promise I won't mention it again.

48
00:03:43,150 --> 00:03:46,310
Don't spend all day
watching your future son-in-law.

49
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,280
You might scare him away.

50
00:03:48,910 --> 00:03:51,360
We still have Cuique and Xiuru.

51
00:03:51,592 --> 00:03:53,512
Help me see
if anyone is suitable for them.

52
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,870
Don't worry, Shunhua.

53
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:56,910
First Madam.

54
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:57,800
Second Madam.

55
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:03,150
There will be many male guests today.

56
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:05,710
Make sure every door
that should be locked is locked.

57
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:06,780
At every entrance and exit,

58
00:04:06,790 --> 00:04:08,570
station some stern servants
to keep watch.

59
00:04:08,584 --> 00:04:11,120
Keep careful track of everyone
who comes and goes.

60
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,560
If anyone who shouldn't enter gets in,

61
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,470
or anyone who shouldn't leave gets out,

62
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,390
I'll hold you responsible.

63
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,630
- Yes.
- Yes.

64
00:04:21,830 --> 00:04:22,950
I have two sons,

65
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,800
but only one daughter.

66
00:04:25,270 --> 00:04:27,430
Normally, when you make a mistake,

67
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:29,310
I turn a blind eye.

68
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,270
But if anything goes wrong today

69
00:04:31,390 --> 00:04:32,750
and Xiuwan becomes a laughingstock,

70
00:04:32,872 --> 00:04:34,690
there'll be no need
for Shunhua to punish you.

71
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,870
Every last one of you

72
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,040
will answer to me.

73
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:38,160
Second Madam,

74
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,310
First Madam, don't worry.

75
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:41,310
We'll keep a close watch today.

76
00:04:41,430 --> 00:04:42,000
Forget people.

77
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,190
Even if a fly gets in,

78
00:04:43,190 --> 00:04:45,000
it won't escape our notice.

79
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:45,800
Good.

80
00:04:47,390 --> 00:04:48,070
You may go.

81
00:04:54,870 --> 00:04:55,950
I've been so focused on

82
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,600
how to entertain the Xie family today

83
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,800
that I overlooked these details.

84
00:05:00,750 --> 00:05:04,240
A great wind begins
with the faintest breeze.

85
00:05:04,568 --> 00:05:06,600
A dike can collapse
from the smallest ant hole.

86
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,600
All the young men and women
here today are unmarried.

87
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,480
A handkerchief

88
00:05:12,870 --> 00:05:13,870
or a sachet

89
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:16,360
could easily become fodder for gossip.

90
00:05:17,656 --> 00:05:20,070
Once a man and woman
are rumored to be secretly involved,

91
00:05:20,216 --> 00:05:22,160
no amount of explaining
can clear their names.

92
00:05:23,112 --> 00:05:25,240
Then an unintended match
could be forced upon them.

93
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,800
They'd have to marry whether

94
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,800
they wanted to or not.

95
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,040
And people would say the Lin family

96
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,360
has no proper standards.

97
00:05:33,070 --> 00:05:33,870
Yes.

98
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:34,630
That's right.

99
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:38,680
We really can't afford
to be careless today.

100
00:05:38,950 --> 00:05:40,920
- Good.
- Good.

101
00:05:41,220 --> 00:05:41,910
This way, please.

102
00:05:42,168 --> 00:05:43,120
- Here.
- Fill it up.

103
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,010
Please.

104
00:05:45,630 --> 00:05:47,750
- Good.
- Good.

105
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:50,310
One point for the blue team.

106
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,430
- Good.
- Good.

107
00:05:58,430 --> 00:05:59,800
One point for the red team.

108
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:04,510
It's not often we can get
everyone together like this.

109
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,190
Really?

110
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,390
Wonderful.

111
00:06:12,870 --> 00:06:14,310
You certainly have a way with words.

112
00:06:20,830 --> 00:06:22,360
Young Ladies, please have some tea.

113
00:06:34,312 --> 00:06:35,560
Look at this embroidery pattern.

114
00:06:40,008 --> 00:06:41,310
The calligraphy is quite good.

115
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,720
I can copy it when I get home.

116
00:06:43,890 --> 00:06:44,950
Here, give it a try.

117
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:45,660
All right.

118
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,600
- Good.
- Good.

119
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:19,270
I heard the Zhao family

120
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,680
is arranging
another match for Zhao Xingtang.

121
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,660
(Niu Fan)
His family background and status

122
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,160
are no less distinguished than yours.

123
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:31,830
Really?

124
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,830
Your flower ornament is beautiful.

125
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,360
Did you make it yourself?

126
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:40,510
I heard he's a high-ranking official
in the Northern Capital

127
00:07:40,750 --> 00:07:43,120
who can speak directly to His Majesty.

128
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:48,160
He's far more powerful
than your brother.

129
00:07:56,070 --> 00:07:56,920
Lin Xiuwan.

130
00:07:57,600 --> 00:08:00,390
You're currently looking for a match.

131
00:08:00,830 --> 00:08:02,390
If you get into a fight today,

132
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,000
you'll ruin your reputation.

133
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,870
No one will dare marry you.

134
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,680
I'm not looking for a match,

135
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,750
so I can fight.

136
00:08:09,870 --> 00:08:10,240
You...

137
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:25,680
I just wanted to offer you
some dried persimmon

138
00:08:26,390 --> 00:08:28,190
to sweeten that mouth of yours.

139
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:29,830
You...

140
00:08:35,150 --> 00:08:36,390
As if I want it.

141
00:08:36,910 --> 00:08:37,360
Let's go.

142
00:08:43,630 --> 00:08:44,630
You're useless.

143
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:47,000
She insulted Jinqi right to your face,

144
00:08:47,150 --> 00:08:48,510
and you didn't even dare talk back.

145
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,600
I'm useless.

146
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,080
It's all my fault.

147
00:08:55,550 --> 00:08:56,510
Xiuwan,

148
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:59,270
don't be so hard on Xiuru.

149
00:08:59,510 --> 00:09:00,870
Xiuru is timid.

150
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,120
She's easily frightened.

151
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,150
Second Young Lady.

152
00:09:05,510 --> 00:09:07,460
(Yinxian, Xiuwan's second-class maid)
Old Madam has a message for you.

153
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,270
What did she say about Jinqi?

154
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:26,240
Nanny Zhou found out everything.

155
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,840
Second Young Master Xie is wearing

156
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,270
a dark teal robe today

157
00:09:29,510 --> 00:09:31,030
with a plum blossom ornament.

158
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:34,750
- Good.
- Good.

159
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:41,000
- Good.
- Good.

160
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:10,790
- Good.
- Good.

161
00:10:35,510 --> 00:10:37,510
I didn't expect Young Master Xie

162
00:10:37,510 --> 00:10:39,032
to be skilled not only in his studies,

163
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,390
but in archery as well.

164
00:10:42,728 --> 00:10:44,440
What nonsense are you talking about?

165
00:10:44,536 --> 00:10:46,180
Watch yourself,
or I'll tell First Madam

166
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,270
and have you slapped.

167
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:50,000
I misspoke.

168
00:10:50,248 --> 00:10:52,000
For now, he's
still Second Young Master Xie.

169
00:10:52,390 --> 00:10:53,600
Only after the wedding

170
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,390
will he be your husband.

171
00:11:00,776 --> 00:11:02,632
I understand everything you've told me.

172
00:11:02,870 --> 00:11:03,630
You may go.

173
00:11:03,910 --> 00:11:04,600
Yes.

174
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:19,510
What did Old Madam tell you

175
00:11:19,870 --> 00:11:21,270
to make you so happy?

176
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:26,630
I'd say

177
00:11:26,630 --> 00:11:28,870
it wasn't something Old Madam said,

178
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:32,870
but one of the men in this garden...

179
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:34,790
Well...

180
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:35,200
You...

181
00:11:39,336 --> 00:11:40,744
It's my fault for being careless.

182
00:11:40,790 --> 00:11:41,150
But...

183
00:11:41,510 --> 00:11:43,030
I was just about to win.

184
00:11:43,140 --> 00:11:44,270
(Xie Feng)

185
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:46,600
(Xie Zhao's younger sister)
We were clearly evenly matched.

186
00:11:46,616 --> 00:11:47,832
There was no winner or loser.

187
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,720
You all saw it.

188
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:52,320
Hurry and settle this for me.

189
00:11:52,870 --> 00:11:54,630
No one can recreate
the game from memory,

190
00:11:54,750 --> 00:11:56,270
so naturally, each side

191
00:11:56,270 --> 00:11:57,600
has its own story.

192
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,080
You...

193
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,192
If you don't know what to say, say less.

194
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:36,600
- Good.
- Good.

195
00:12:46,670 --> 00:12:48,360
- Good.
- Good.

196
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:49,510
Impressive!

197
00:12:49,510 --> 00:12:51,064
(Lin Jinqiao, Madam Wang's son,
Third Young Master of the Lin family)

198
00:12:53,750 --> 00:12:54,390
Jinqi.

199
00:12:54,550 --> 00:12:56,320
Zheng is incredible.

200
00:12:58,630 --> 00:12:59,390
Zheng,

201
00:12:59,390 --> 00:13:00,510
that was really impressive.

202
00:13:00,510 --> 00:13:01,870
Let's go hunting together sometime.

203
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:02,600
Sure.

204
00:13:04,152 --> 00:13:06,910
Jinqi, you'd better be ready
to drink until you drop this time.

205
00:13:08,390 --> 00:13:10,000
Don't forget what we're here for today.

206
00:13:10,870 --> 00:13:12,200
Xiuwan's marriage.

207
00:13:15,336 --> 00:13:16,390
You mean the Xie family?

208
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:20,670
Don't worry.

209
00:13:20,670 --> 00:13:21,510
There's still time.

210
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:24,670
- Good.
- Good.

211
00:13:24,670 --> 00:13:25,270
Impressive!

212
00:13:25,270 --> 00:13:26,632
Another point for the blue team.

213
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:27,960
Excellent shot!

214
00:13:32,940 --> 00:13:36,860
(Xie Zhao, courtesy name Xianzhang)

215
00:13:37,550 --> 00:13:41,750
The Lin family can barely
be considered a scholarly family.

216
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:46,790
How is it that the younger generation
is so uncultivated,

217
00:13:47,270 --> 00:13:49,510
without a trace of literary refinement?

218
00:13:49,670 --> 00:13:50,870
- Good.
- Good.

219
00:13:51,750 --> 00:13:52,670
No wonder.

220
00:14:02,968 --> 00:14:05,660
(Lin Jinlan, son of Lin Changzheng's
concubine, Second Young Master)

221
00:14:05,670 --> 00:14:07,080
You have quite a discerning eye.

222
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:09,910
May I ask which family you're from?

223
00:14:10,910 --> 00:14:11,870
I'm Xie Zhao,

224
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:13,128
courtesy name Xianzhang,

225
00:14:13,790 --> 00:14:15,670
of the Xie family
of Meizigang, Yuhuatai.

226
00:14:17,510 --> 00:14:19,000
So you're a descendant of Lord Xie.

227
00:14:19,670 --> 00:14:22,600
The histories describe
Lord Xie as refined and perceptive,

228
00:14:22,744 --> 00:14:24,408
with an elegant
and distinguished bearing.

229
00:14:24,790 --> 00:14:25,840
Seeing you today,

230
00:14:27,128 --> 00:14:29,544
I find the words of
the ancients were indeed true.

231
00:14:30,670 --> 00:14:31,870
May I ask your name?

232
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,270
I'm Lin Jinlan,

233
00:14:33,510 --> 00:14:34,320
courtesy name Suiyun,

234
00:14:34,790 --> 00:14:35,870
from the Lin family,

235
00:14:36,248 --> 00:14:38,350
which can barely
be considered a scholarly family.

236
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:39,240
Good.

237
00:14:43,992 --> 00:14:45,624
Jinlan, when did you get here?

238
00:14:46,510 --> 00:14:49,390
It seems you and Xianzhang
have already met.

239
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,824
No need for me to introduce you.

240
00:14:54,390 --> 00:14:55,440
I heard all the excitement,

241
00:14:56,030 --> 00:14:57,080
so I came to join in.

242
00:15:00,150 --> 00:15:02,720
Which team are you on, Xianzhang?

243
00:15:04,504 --> 00:15:05,740
I stepped away
to relieve myself earlier.

244
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:08,104
I accidentally got my clothes wet
while washing my hands,

245
00:15:08,110 --> 00:15:09,064
so I changed.

246
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:10,600
Then I forgot my ribbon.

247
00:15:10,870 --> 00:15:11,670
Second Young Master.

248
00:15:13,910 --> 00:15:14,840
You forgot this.

249
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,200
Go on.

250
00:15:19,670 --> 00:15:20,790
I'm on the red team,

251
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:22,670
with Fengtai.

252
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:26,360
Neither Xianzhang nor I
care much for archery.

253
00:15:26,390 --> 00:15:27,640
It's rather dull to just watch.

254
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:30,080
Why don't we
make friends through poetry,

255
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,736
with drinking games and liquor?

256
00:15:32,030 --> 00:15:32,670
Sounds good.

257
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:35,510
Suiyun, do you know

258
00:15:35,510 --> 00:15:37,320
any witty drinking games
involving poetry?

259
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:42,390
Use lines from the Four Books and Five
Classics to match names of medicines.

260
00:15:44,870 --> 00:15:45,670
That's a good one.

261
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:48,910
You'd have to know the Four Books
and Five Classics by heart

262
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:50,320
and be well-versed in medicine

263
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,750
to play this drinking game.

264
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,790
Refined and entertaining.

265
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:55,720
Just to my liking.

266
00:15:56,712 --> 00:15:58,120
I've been frail since childhood.

267
00:15:58,472 --> 00:15:59,720
Before I even learned to eat,

268
00:15:59,790 --> 00:16:01,304
I'd already learned to take medicine.

269
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,920
I wouldn't say my illnesses
made me a doctor,

270
00:16:04,030 --> 00:16:05,496
but I've read a few medical books.

271
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:06,960
That gives me a slight advantage.

272
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:08,120
Not at all.

273
00:16:08,750 --> 00:16:09,910
We Xie children

274
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:12,750
are expected to read widely
from an early age.

275
00:16:12,888 --> 00:16:14,600
We've read plenty
of medical classics, too.

276
00:16:14,750 --> 00:16:15,670
So it's no advantage.

277
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:18,790
Good.

278
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:21,000
Then it's settled.

279
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,750
We'll keep the red and blue teams.

280
00:16:22,808 --> 00:16:25,864
Match lines from the Four Books and
Five Classics with names of medicines.

281
00:16:55,900 --> 00:16:57,180
(The Story of the Lute)

282
00:16:57,224 --> 00:16:58,820
(Revised Edition
of The Story of the Lute, Volume One)

283
00:17:06,700 --> 00:17:12,740
(The Story of the Lute)

284
00:17:46,460 --> 00:17:48,060
(Larkspur)

285
00:17:49,310 --> 00:17:51,030
Larkspur...

286
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:58,270
Take this back to the room.

287
00:18:00,270 --> 00:18:01,000
On the seventh,

288
00:18:01,110 --> 00:18:02,310
it'll be perfect to wear.

289
00:18:02,830 --> 00:18:03,550
All right.

290
00:18:03,620 --> 00:18:05,540
(Travels in the Western Regions)

291
00:18:05,550 --> 00:18:08,240
(Xiaolian mentions
Young Lady Du's given name,)

292
00:18:08,856 --> 00:18:10,872
(Cuique.)
[*"Cuique" also refers to larkspur in Chinese]

293
00:18:11,128 --> 00:18:13,304
(Young Master wore
a larkspur flower ornament.)

294
00:18:13,704 --> 00:18:15,224
(Travels in the Western Regions)

295
00:18:26,310 --> 00:18:27,790
(I want to start over)

296
00:18:28,168 --> 00:18:29,680
(and live a better life than before.)

297
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,440
(I hope)

298
00:18:33,510 --> 00:18:35,070
(you can live better lives, too.)

299
00:18:50,180 --> 00:18:52,940
(Travels in the Western Regions)

300
00:19:03,550 --> 00:19:04,240
Gantang.

301
00:19:05,310 --> 00:19:07,160
Where are you going in such a hurry?

302
00:19:07,310 --> 00:19:09,110
I'm taking something to Yuchan.

303
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:11,160
All the masters are in the garden today.

304
00:19:11,170 --> 00:19:12,990
I thought I'd enjoy
the rare peace and quiet,

305
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,240
and I got a few crabapples,

306
00:19:14,424 --> 00:19:16,680
so I was going to Luxue Lodge
to chat with Xiaolian.

307
00:19:16,790 --> 00:19:17,830
But guess what?

308
00:19:18,310 --> 00:19:19,960
All the garden gates were locked.

309
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:21,400
I went round and round

310
00:19:21,550 --> 00:19:22,888
until I reached Chenxiang Pavilion

311
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:24,350
and finally found an entrance.

312
00:19:24,550 --> 00:19:26,110
But there were two fierce old servants

313
00:19:26,110 --> 00:19:27,960
guarding it and refusing
to let anyone through.

314
00:19:28,590 --> 00:19:30,440
Yuchan is still at the banquet.

315
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:32,040
Even if you go, they won't let you in.

316
00:19:32,160 --> 00:19:33,592
There's no point making the trip.

317
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:34,960
But I have something important

318
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:36,000
to give Yuchan.

319
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:37,830
Can't those servants make an exception?

320
00:19:38,296 --> 00:19:40,136
Those two servants
looked downright fierce

321
00:19:40,248 --> 00:19:42,400
and wouldn't
make an exception for anyone.

322
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:44,568
(Plowing the Clouds, Sowing the Moon)
I'd never seen them before.

323
00:19:44,750 --> 00:19:47,440
I don't know what backwater
they found these stubborn women in.

324
00:19:50,750 --> 00:19:51,960
I don't have to go in.

325
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:54,110
Could you please send someone
to call Yuchan for me?

326
00:19:54,184 --> 00:19:56,216
I really have
something important to give her.

327
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:57,350
Yuchan

328
00:19:57,350 --> 00:19:58,790
is the head maid of Zhichun Hall.

329
00:19:58,960 --> 00:19:59,790
Even First Madam

330
00:19:59,920 --> 00:20:01,304
listens to what she has to say.

331
00:20:06,550 --> 00:20:09,030
Please have some of these crabapples.

332
00:20:10,110 --> 00:20:11,270
They're a small gift for you.

333
00:20:11,550 --> 00:20:12,160
Go.

334
00:20:13,070 --> 00:20:14,160
Yuchan, Jinchan,

335
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:14,990
whatever her name is.

336
00:20:15,070 --> 00:20:16,830
I only know
First Madam gave strict orders

337
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,920
that none of you may pass through here.

338
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:23,480
Calling each other sisters
sounds very nice,

339
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:25,848
but I bet you're really
after the young masters inside.

340
00:20:25,880 --> 00:20:28,160
You think a pretty face
will help you climb the ladder?

341
00:20:28,420 --> 00:20:28,940
Bah!

342
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:30,070
Shameless hussy.

343
00:20:30,070 --> 00:20:30,720
Wretched girl.

344
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:31,510
How can you

345
00:20:31,510 --> 00:20:32,640
say such awful things?

346
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:33,350
Go.

347
00:20:33,550 --> 00:20:35,000
- Go. Go.
- Hurry up.

348
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:35,440
Lanxiang.

349
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:35,960
Go!

350
00:20:37,350 --> 00:20:37,960
Go!

351
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:38,640
Go!

352
00:20:39,110 --> 00:20:39,510
Go!

353
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:40,830
Go!

354
00:20:49,110 --> 00:20:49,920
Lanxiang.

355
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:52,480
Is this urgent?

356
00:20:52,550 --> 00:20:54,030
Can't it wait until after the banquet?

357
00:20:55,750 --> 00:20:56,750
After the banquet,

358
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,240
everything will already be settled

359
00:20:58,750 --> 00:20:59,960
and there'll be an outcome.

360
00:21:02,070 --> 00:21:03,830
There's no other way right now.

361
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:06,000
Those two servants won't budge.

362
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:07,310
They won't even take money.

363
00:21:07,830 --> 00:21:09,920
It seems First Madam
gave them strict orders

364
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:11,550
not to let anyone in or out.

365
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:24,200
What's wrong?

366
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:38,270
We can't get in,

367
00:21:39,030 --> 00:21:40,310
but someone else can.

368
00:21:43,720 --> 00:21:45,240
Is this your pellet?

369
00:21:56,140 --> 00:21:57,860
(Lin Jincen, Madam Wang's son,
Fourth Young Master of the Lin family)

370
00:21:57,880 --> 00:21:58,750
Who are you?

371
00:21:58,920 --> 00:22:00,590
How did you know I was hiding here?

372
00:22:03,680 --> 00:22:04,350
Come on, hurry!

373
00:22:04,350 --> 00:22:05,440
If you lose, you drink.

374
00:22:05,440 --> 00:22:06,460
Come on, everyone, drink.

375
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:07,880
Give us another one.

376
00:22:08,640 --> 00:22:09,790
Another one.

377
00:22:09,992 --> 00:22:11,460
- You go first.
- That's not enough.

378
00:22:11,550 --> 00:22:12,960
After three nights, he left Zhou.

379
00:22:13,510 --> 00:22:14,450
Wang Bu Liu Xing.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "the king does not make one stay."]

380
00:22:14,460 --> 00:22:15,550
Well said. Wang Bu Liu Xing.

381
00:22:15,550 --> 00:22:16,260
- Good.
- Good.

382
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:17,350
Drink.

383
00:22:17,510 --> 00:22:20,480
- Drink.
- Drink.

384
00:22:20,952 --> 00:22:23,030
The young men of my circle
are bold and unrestrained.

385
00:22:23,112 --> 00:22:24,300
Dang Gui.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "ought to return."]

386
00:22:24,310 --> 00:22:25,270
- Good.
- Good.

387
00:22:25,270 --> 00:22:27,830
- Drink.
- Drink.

388
00:22:30,424 --> 00:22:32,400
Between the seventh
and eighth months, drought sets in.

389
00:22:32,424 --> 00:22:33,820
Ban Xia.
[*A medicinal herb means "half summer."]

390
00:22:33,830 --> 00:22:34,640
- Good.
- Good.

391
00:22:34,720 --> 00:22:35,350
- Good.
- Good.

392
00:22:37,110 --> 00:22:38,920
- Drink.
- Drink.

393
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:39,550
Drink.

394
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:40,310
Drink.

395
00:22:42,240 --> 00:22:43,440
Guan Zhong did not die.

396
00:22:43,450 --> 00:22:44,260
Du Huo.
[*A medicinal herb means "to live alone."]

397
00:22:44,270 --> 00:22:45,000
- Good.
- Good.

398
00:22:45,510 --> 00:22:46,510
Well done, Jinlan.

399
00:22:46,510 --> 00:22:47,270
Drink.

400
00:22:51,830 --> 00:22:54,880
When the state has lost its way,
one may withdraw and hide.

401
00:22:54,936 --> 00:22:56,990
Chan Tui.
[*A medicinal herb means "cicada slough."]

402
00:22:57,400 --> 00:22:58,200
- Good.
- Good.

403
00:22:59,272 --> 00:23:00,200
- Come on.
- Drink.

404
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:01,920
Zheng, give us another one.

405
00:23:02,270 --> 00:23:02,920
Let me think.

406
00:23:04,510 --> 00:23:05,270
Another one.

407
00:23:05,270 --> 00:23:05,920
Think.

408
00:23:08,056 --> 00:23:09,304
One studies from an early age.

409
00:23:09,368 --> 00:23:11,592
Yuan Zhi.
[*A medicinal herb means "lofty aspiration."]

410
00:23:11,640 --> 00:23:13,160
- Good.
- Good.

411
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:14,240
Well said. Yuan Zhi.

412
00:23:14,590 --> 00:23:15,270
Drink.

413
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:16,920
A child still in his tender years.

414
00:23:16,980 --> 00:23:19,140
Ru Xiang.
[*A medicinal herb means "milk fragrance."]

415
00:23:19,192 --> 00:23:21,710
Zeng Xi died. Ku Shen.
[*A medicinal herb means "bitter ginseng."]

416
00:23:21,720 --> 00:23:22,920
With righteousness in one's heart.

417
00:23:22,920 --> 00:23:23,590
Jue Ming Zi.
[*A medicinal herb means "clear discernment."]

418
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:24,440
Good.

419
00:23:24,510 --> 00:23:26,630
Jieyu, the Madman of Chu,
passed by Confucius' carriage singing.

420
00:23:26,640 --> 00:23:27,400
Che Qian Zi.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "seed before the carriage."]

421
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,350
Suffering from a cold ailment.

422
00:23:28,360 --> 00:23:29,440
Fang Feng.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "guard against wind."]

423
00:23:29,590 --> 00:23:30,480
- Good!
- Good!

424
00:23:32,504 --> 00:23:34,030
A petty man's virtue bends like grass.

425
00:23:34,120 --> 00:23:35,224
Sui Feng Zi.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "one who follows the wind."]

426
00:23:35,304 --> 00:23:36,030
Good one!

427
00:23:36,232 --> 00:23:37,960
Wherever boats and carts can reach.

428
00:23:38,008 --> 00:23:38,950
Mu Tong.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "wood passage."]

429
00:23:38,960 --> 00:23:39,750
- Good!
- Good!

430
00:23:39,750 --> 00:23:40,680
Good one!

431
00:23:40,680 --> 00:23:41,590
- Good one.
- Drink!

432
00:23:41,976 --> 00:23:44,456
Remaining in his place
while all the stars gather around him.

433
00:23:44,510 --> 00:23:45,440
Tian Nan Xing.
[*A medicinal herb means "southern star."]

434
00:23:45,450 --> 00:23:46,990
The peach tree blooms
in all its splendor.

435
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:47,790
Hong Hua.
[*A medicinal herb means "red flower."]

436
00:23:47,816 --> 00:23:49,070
- Restore fallen states.
- Good!

437
00:23:49,070 --> 00:23:50,340
Continue lines that have died out.

438
00:23:50,350 --> 00:23:51,160
Xu Duan.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "restore what is broken."]

439
00:23:51,270 --> 00:23:52,590
Like breaching the banks
of the Yangtze and Yellow Rivers.

440
00:23:52,600 --> 00:23:53,550
Ze Xie.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "marsh drainage."]

441
00:23:53,550 --> 00:23:54,270
- Good!
- Good!

442
00:23:54,328 --> 00:23:55,496
Dyed black,
yet never stained.

443
00:23:55,500 --> 00:23:56,550
Ren Zhong Bai.
[*A medicinal substance.]

444
00:23:56,750 --> 00:23:57,790
- Good!
- Good!

445
00:23:58,920 --> 00:24:00,070
You can't think of anything?

446
00:24:01,200 --> 00:24:02,350
You're going to lose.

447
00:24:02,590 --> 00:24:03,590
Come on.

448
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:04,960
All right.

449
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:07,160
Settle your drinking debt first.

450
00:24:07,256 --> 00:24:08,310
Drink everything you owe.

451
00:24:08,510 --> 00:24:09,270
That's right.

452
00:24:12,310 --> 00:24:13,070
Drink up.

453
00:24:13,070 --> 00:24:13,830
Come on, drink.

454
00:24:16,080 --> 00:24:16,840
Yes, yes. Come on.

455
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:17,640
Fengtai.

456
00:24:17,830 --> 00:24:18,400
Xianzhang.

457
00:24:23,510 --> 00:24:24,160
Wait.

458
00:24:24,790 --> 00:24:25,590
I've got one.

459
00:24:27,288 --> 00:24:28,550
It's on the tip of my tongue.

460
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:31,720
Say it, then.

461
00:24:32,350 --> 00:24:33,480
Cangwu Feicui.

462
00:24:33,912 --> 00:24:36,008
Cuique.
[*A medicinal herb's name, larkspur.]

463
00:24:36,480 --> 00:24:37,790
Cuique?

464
00:24:37,920 --> 00:24:39,960
Cuique...

465
00:24:39,960 --> 00:24:41,480
Cangwu Feicui

466
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:42,480
is mentioned

467
00:24:43,160 --> 00:24:44,070
in the Book of Zhou.

468
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:45,920
The Shuowen Jiezi describes

469
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:47,000
"fei"

470
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:48,590
as a red-feathered bird,

471
00:24:49,030 --> 00:24:49,640
and "cui"

472
00:24:49,816 --> 00:24:51,030
as a green-feathered bird.

473
00:24:51,510 --> 00:24:53,790
Together, "feicui" refers to Cuique.

474
00:24:54,720 --> 00:24:56,750
What kind of medicine is larkspur?

475
00:24:56,750 --> 00:24:58,030
I've never heard of it.

476
00:24:58,200 --> 00:25:00,070
Larkspur tastes bitter

477
00:25:00,120 --> 00:25:01,928
and is warm in nature.
It is highly toxic.

478
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:03,890
Its tuberous roots can
be used medicinally after processing.

479
00:25:03,900 --> 00:25:06,260
It clears heat and toxins,
reduces swelling and relieves pain.

480
00:25:06,270 --> 00:25:07,480
It is a foreign medicinal herb,

481
00:25:08,070 --> 00:25:09,200
rarely seen in Jiangnan.

482
00:25:09,310 --> 00:25:11,030
I only happened to come across it

483
00:25:11,096 --> 00:25:12,580
in a book from my family's collection.

484
00:25:13,030 --> 00:25:15,720
If Fengtai hadn't happened
to be wearing one today,

485
00:25:15,880 --> 00:25:18,640
I wouldn't have
thought of it so quickly.

486
00:25:19,070 --> 00:25:19,880
Gentlemen,

487
00:25:19,960 --> 00:25:21,272
thank you for letting me win.

488
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:24,270
Cuique...

489
00:25:24,472 --> 00:25:26,110
Isn't that Young Lady Du's given name?

490
00:25:26,110 --> 00:25:26,590
Jinqiao,

491
00:25:29,030 --> 00:25:30,400
isn't Young Lady Du

492
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:32,000
staying at the Lin Residence now?

493
00:25:32,440 --> 00:25:34,670
You certainly have
the advantage of being close to her.

494
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:36,000
It seems a happy occasion is near.

495
00:25:36,792 --> 00:25:37,680
Isn't that right?

496
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:40,270
No wonder the magpies have been calling

497
00:25:40,270 --> 00:25:41,480
in pairs all day.

498
00:25:41,480 --> 00:25:42,030
Exactly.

499
00:25:42,030 --> 00:25:43,160
Fengtai should certainly

500
00:25:43,160 --> 00:25:44,080
drink a toast with us.

501
00:25:44,100 --> 00:25:46,160
I heard Congyi
once took a blade for Fengtai.

502
00:25:46,310 --> 00:25:48,160
So Fengtai is going to repay

503
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:49,920
that life-saving favor with himself?

504
00:25:50,030 --> 00:25:50,830
Right?

505
00:25:51,110 --> 00:25:51,640
Have a drink.

506
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:52,440
Right?

507
00:25:52,510 --> 00:25:53,030
Come on.

508
00:25:55,720 --> 00:25:56,480
Have a drink.

509
00:25:56,480 --> 00:25:57,350
Come on. Have a drink.

510
00:25:57,350 --> 00:25:58,640
You've got to drink to that.

511
00:25:59,070 --> 00:25:59,880
Right?

512
00:25:59,880 --> 00:26:00,310
Come on.

513
00:26:00,310 --> 00:26:01,240
Have a drink.

514
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:01,550
Come on.

515
00:26:01,550 --> 00:26:01,920
Have one.

516
00:26:01,930 --> 00:26:02,310
Have one.

517
00:26:02,310 --> 00:26:03,270
Come on.

518
00:26:03,480 --> 00:26:03,920
Come on.

519
00:26:03,920 --> 00:26:06,550
- Have one.
- Have one.

520
00:26:06,750 --> 00:26:07,480
Come on, have one.

521
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:10,960
- Have a drink.
- Have a drink.

522
00:26:10,960 --> 00:26:11,490
Have a drink.

523
00:26:29,830 --> 00:26:30,640
Today...

524
00:26:31,640 --> 00:26:33,510
Old Master is here.

525
00:27:07,350 --> 00:27:08,000
Gentlemen,

526
00:27:08,648 --> 00:27:09,704
to tell you the truth,

527
00:27:10,168 --> 00:27:11,752
I really didn't know what kind of flower

528
00:27:11,768 --> 00:27:12,830
I was wearing today.

529
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:15,270
Since it was a flower from Grandfather,

530
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:17,480
of course, I had to wear it.

531
00:27:25,510 --> 00:27:26,200
Grandfather.

532
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:34,480
You know nothing about farming,

533
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:38,480
so you don't appreciate
the value of this flower.

534
00:27:39,680 --> 00:27:42,200
The entire larkspur plant is poisonous.

535
00:27:42,760 --> 00:27:44,440
Once dried and ground into powder,

536
00:27:44,450 --> 00:27:46,610
it can be mixed with water
and sprayed over the fields

537
00:27:46,680 --> 00:27:48,510
to kill insects that damage the crops

538
00:27:48,680 --> 00:27:50,160
and help ensure a good harvest.

539
00:27:50,480 --> 00:27:52,510
As expected of the Xie family.

540
00:27:52,790 --> 00:27:54,240
You are widely read

541
00:27:54,510 --> 00:27:56,310
and full of learning.

542
00:27:57,270 --> 00:27:57,920
All right.

543
00:27:59,270 --> 00:28:00,070
These flowers...

544
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:03,270
Each of you take one.

545
00:28:12,550 --> 00:28:13,030
Take one.

546
00:28:13,240 --> 00:28:16,640
Always remember
that food is vital to the people,

547
00:28:17,510 --> 00:28:19,830
and agriculture
is the foundation of the nation.

548
00:28:21,144 --> 00:28:24,808
- Thank you for your guidance, Grandfather.
- Thank you for your guidance, Old Master.

549
00:28:49,830 --> 00:28:50,920
This flower is beautiful.

550
00:28:57,480 --> 00:28:58,640
We'll take our leave now.

551
00:29:17,750 --> 00:29:18,350
Cuique.

552
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:19,030
It's your turn.

553
00:29:29,960 --> 00:29:31,960
Don't knock over
the pieces again this time.

554
00:29:33,030 --> 00:29:34,750
I was just about to win.

555
00:29:39,550 --> 00:29:40,160
Xiuru.

556
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:03,440
Young Lady Du.

557
00:30:03,640 --> 00:30:05,000
First Madam wants to see you.

558
00:30:29,500 --> 00:30:32,300
(Resounding Call)

559
00:30:35,510 --> 00:30:36,110
First Madam.

560
00:30:39,350 --> 00:30:39,830
Come.

561
00:30:43,848 --> 00:30:45,030
Sit down and we'll talk.

562
00:30:53,550 --> 00:30:54,590
Cuique.

563
00:30:56,880 --> 00:30:59,070
What does your name mean?

564
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:05,830
Everyone thinks
I'm named after a kind of bird.

565
00:31:07,030 --> 00:31:08,070
But I'm not.

566
00:31:08,640 --> 00:31:10,160
Like the morning glory,

567
00:31:10,720 --> 00:31:12,160
it's a kind of blue flower.

568
00:31:20,030 --> 00:31:21,200
Is this it?

569
00:31:23,480 --> 00:31:25,880
This is a larkspur
flower ornament I made.

570
00:31:26,240 --> 00:31:27,680
Since it matches my name,

571
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:29,440
I made a few extra

572
00:31:29,480 --> 00:31:31,110
to wear from time to time.

573
00:31:31,310 --> 00:31:33,510
How did this get here?

574
00:31:36,510 --> 00:31:38,400
Did you give Jinqi

575
00:31:39,070 --> 00:31:40,200
a larkspur flower ornament?

576
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:44,480
First Madam.

577
00:31:44,808 --> 00:31:47,110
Though I come from a military
household and grew up poor,

578
00:31:47,176 --> 00:31:49,368
I was taught to read
and know right from wrong.

579
00:31:50,270 --> 00:31:52,110
How could I do something so improper?

580
00:31:56,590 --> 00:31:57,480
Good child.

581
00:31:58,000 --> 00:31:58,830
Don't worry.

582
00:31:59,400 --> 00:32:01,920
Whatever the misunderstanding is,
we can clear it up.

583
00:32:06,240 --> 00:32:08,070
Among the festive ornaments
you gave Jinqi,

584
00:32:08,640 --> 00:32:10,480
there was a larkspur flower ornament.

585
00:32:11,640 --> 00:32:14,000
Think carefully about how that happened.

586
00:32:20,200 --> 00:32:21,000
That day,

587
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:24,790
because I had gifts for so many people,

588
00:32:26,160 --> 00:32:27,920
I was busy making the festive ornaments

589
00:32:28,480 --> 00:32:29,920
while asking Xiaolian

590
00:32:30,350 --> 00:32:33,030
to put them into the box.

591
00:32:34,310 --> 00:32:37,110
Later, Xiaolian was also
the one carrying the box

592
00:32:37,192 --> 00:32:39,080
when she accompanied me to Zhichun Hall.

593
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:40,200
Xiaolian.

594
00:32:40,480 --> 00:32:41,400
There's no rush.

595
00:32:41,480 --> 00:32:42,310
Pack them carefully.

596
00:32:43,070 --> 00:32:44,590
We were extremely busy that day.

597
00:32:44,720 --> 00:32:47,510
From beginning to end,
I never touched the box.

598
00:32:48,270 --> 00:32:49,350
Thinking about it now,

599
00:32:50,070 --> 00:32:52,920
Xiaolian must have
made a mistake in the confusion.

600
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:56,590
I thought they were only
inexpensive festive ornaments,

601
00:32:59,640 --> 00:33:01,110
so I didn't think to check them.

602
00:33:01,110 --> 00:33:02,240
It's all my fault.

603
00:33:02,510 --> 00:33:04,160
I was too careless.

604
00:33:10,680 --> 00:33:11,550
Good child.

605
00:33:12,424 --> 00:33:14,936
As long as we've
cleared things up, that's enough.

606
00:33:16,510 --> 00:33:17,000
Come.

607
00:33:20,030 --> 00:33:22,240
Nothing happened in the end,

608
00:33:22,790 --> 00:33:24,240
so don't take it to heart.

609
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:28,270
Everything's fine now.

610
00:33:29,790 --> 00:33:30,400
All right.

611
00:33:33,720 --> 00:33:35,400
Then how did
this larkspur flower ornament

612
00:33:35,880 --> 00:33:37,920
get from Young Lady Du's room

613
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:40,350
onto Young Master's head?

614
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:43,070
Lanxiang.

615
00:33:43,070 --> 00:33:43,920
Stay right there.

616
00:33:46,536 --> 00:33:48,030
If Lanxiang hadn't been quick-witted

617
00:33:48,184 --> 00:33:49,880
and Old Master hadn't arrived in time,

618
00:33:50,440 --> 00:33:52,640
I'd be making arrangements

619
00:33:52,640 --> 00:33:54,216
for Young Master to take a concubine,

620
00:33:54,310 --> 00:33:55,830
while everyone in Jinling City

621
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:56,830
pointed fingers at us

622
00:33:56,830 --> 00:33:59,480
and accused the Lin family
of having no proper standards.

623
00:33:59,864 --> 00:34:01,920
We claim we're repaying
a debt of gratitude,

624
00:34:02,240 --> 00:34:03,920
yet we'd have lured an orphaned,

625
00:34:03,992 --> 00:34:05,608
respectable young lady into our home

626
00:34:05,672 --> 00:34:08,070
and made her a concubine
without a proper matchmaker!

627
00:34:08,590 --> 00:34:10,070
Young Master meant well.

628
00:34:10,104 --> 00:34:12,290
He was afraid Young Lady Du
might take it the wrong way

629
00:34:12,440 --> 00:34:13,960
and think we found her gift too modest,

630
00:34:14,232 --> 00:34:16,840
so he made a point of wearing
the flower ornament she gave him.

631
00:34:17,528 --> 00:34:19,272
It was all my fault for being careless

632
00:34:19,288 --> 00:34:21,150
and not finding out
what kind of flower it was.

633
00:34:21,360 --> 00:34:22,744
Please punish me, First Madam.

634
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:24,630
Please punish me.

635
00:34:26,800 --> 00:34:27,590
Xiaolian!

636
00:34:31,510 --> 00:34:34,710
Young Lady Du was busy
making festive ornaments that day.

637
00:34:35,400 --> 00:34:36,880
I was the one who packed the box.

638
00:34:38,280 --> 00:34:41,190
Young Lady Du never told me
to put in a larkspur flower ornament,

639
00:34:42,230 --> 00:34:43,510
and I didn't put one in, either.

640
00:34:43,800 --> 00:34:44,280
I...

641
00:34:44,550 --> 00:34:46,630
I don't know how it ended up in the box.

642
00:34:47,510 --> 00:34:49,360
I must have put it in by mistake.

643
00:34:51,550 --> 00:34:52,360
First Madam.

644
00:34:52,960 --> 00:34:54,000
I made a mistake.

645
00:34:54,070 --> 00:34:55,400
Please give me a good beating.

646
00:34:56,510 --> 00:34:57,110
No.

647
00:34:57,630 --> 00:35:00,840
My mother says beatings
never teach me a lesson.

648
00:35:01,320 --> 00:35:02,710
Beating me won't work.

649
00:35:03,760 --> 00:35:06,590
First Madam, don't give me any food.

650
00:35:06,800 --> 00:35:08,110
Starve me until I can't bear it.

651
00:35:08,670 --> 00:35:09,800
Three days without food.

652
00:35:10,150 --> 00:35:10,630
No.

653
00:35:10,840 --> 00:35:12,030
Five days without food.

654
00:35:12,400 --> 00:35:13,760
Once I'm nearly starving,

655
00:35:13,880 --> 00:35:15,150
I'll definitely remember.

656
00:35:15,256 --> 00:35:16,936
I'll never make the same mistake again.

657
00:35:16,940 --> 00:35:17,590
That's enough.

658
00:35:18,710 --> 00:35:19,920
Speak properly.

659
00:35:21,150 --> 00:35:23,840
Did you know this was
a larkspur flower ornament?

660
00:35:25,840 --> 00:35:26,840
No.

661
00:35:27,480 --> 00:35:29,190
When I saw Young Lady Du making it,

662
00:35:29,272 --> 00:35:31,110
I even asked her
about it out of curiosity.

663
00:35:31,880 --> 00:35:32,960
Young Lady Du

664
00:35:34,550 --> 00:35:36,030
just smiled.

665
00:35:36,550 --> 00:35:38,510
It wasn't until Lanxiang and Nanny Wu

666
00:35:38,510 --> 00:35:40,060
came to Luxue Lodge looking for me today

667
00:35:40,070 --> 00:35:42,110
that I learned it was
a larkspur flower ornament.

668
00:35:46,030 --> 00:35:46,670
Nanny Han.

669
00:35:46,800 --> 00:35:47,360
Yuchan.

670
00:35:47,360 --> 00:35:48,150
Xiaolian.

671
00:35:48,480 --> 00:35:49,800
Forfeit six months' wages.

672
00:35:50,480 --> 00:35:52,960
Nanny Han and Yuchan,
twenty strikes with the ruler.

673
00:35:53,230 --> 00:35:54,030
Xiaolian,

674
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:57,070
twenty strikes with the ruler

675
00:35:57,280 --> 00:35:58,510
and no food for three days.

676
00:36:00,190 --> 00:36:00,840
- Yes.
- Yes.

677
00:36:29,230 --> 00:36:30,000
Lanxiang.

678
00:36:34,480 --> 00:36:35,550
This is your reward.

679
00:36:50,000 --> 00:36:50,590
First Madam.

680
00:36:50,710 --> 00:36:51,190
This...

681
00:36:51,480 --> 00:36:52,480
Keep it safe.

682
00:36:53,230 --> 00:36:56,190
Tell everyone I rewarded you
with ten taels of silver,

683
00:36:56,630 --> 00:36:58,070
so no one gets jealous.

684
00:36:58,510 --> 00:37:01,590
From now on, just as you did today,

685
00:37:02,030 --> 00:37:04,840
continue to do your best in everything.

686
00:37:06,568 --> 00:37:08,232
Thank you for the reward, First Madam.

687
00:37:09,360 --> 00:37:10,710
Could I take just one gold ingot

688
00:37:11,360 --> 00:37:13,920
and ask you to give Nanny Han
and the others fewer strikes?

689
00:37:18,190 --> 00:37:19,000
No.

690
00:37:20,670 --> 00:37:21,840
But after they're punished,

691
00:37:22,000 --> 00:37:24,070
Nanny Wu will bring them
the finest medicine.

692
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:30,800
Today,

693
00:37:31,550 --> 00:37:33,030
Gantang was with me.

694
00:37:33,760 --> 00:37:34,960
Will she be rewarded, too?

695
00:37:37,510 --> 00:37:38,230
Yes.

696
00:37:40,150 --> 00:37:41,280
Is there anything else?

697
00:37:44,840 --> 00:37:45,590
Go back.

698
00:37:45,640 --> 00:37:47,672
The Young Master
still has some questions for you.

699
00:37:49,190 --> 00:37:49,760
Yes.

700
00:37:59,840 --> 00:38:01,440
Zheng gave me a slingshot.

701
00:38:01,800 --> 00:38:04,800
I ran into Lanxiang
while I was shooting birds with it.

702
00:38:06,320 --> 00:38:07,320
Who are you?

703
00:38:07,480 --> 00:38:09,150
How did you know I was hiding here?

704
00:38:10,360 --> 00:38:11,760
I saw a bird suddenly fly off,

705
00:38:11,840 --> 00:38:13,230
and then noticed your pellet.

706
00:38:13,304 --> 00:38:14,280
With a little attention,

707
00:38:14,280 --> 00:38:16,216
it wasn't hard
to guess where you were hiding.

708
00:38:25,128 --> 00:38:26,070
Fourth Young Master.

709
00:38:26,984 --> 00:38:28,376
Do you know how to use one?

710
00:38:31,510 --> 00:38:32,320
No.

711
00:38:33,590 --> 00:38:34,480
That's no fun.

712
00:38:35,840 --> 00:38:36,760
But I know someone

713
00:38:36,760 --> 00:38:38,456
who's very good at making slingshots.

714
00:38:38,872 --> 00:38:41,096
His slingshots
can hit a bird almost every time.

715
00:38:41,320 --> 00:38:42,030
Really?

716
00:38:42,568 --> 00:38:44,540
I wouldn't dare lie to you,
Fourth Young Master.

717
00:38:44,710 --> 00:38:46,030
Uncle Liu from my neighborhood

718
00:38:46,070 --> 00:38:47,280
is quite a craftsman

719
00:38:47,336 --> 00:38:48,730
and very good at making slingshots.

720
00:38:48,740 --> 00:38:50,420
The Lv family next door
has many children.

721
00:38:50,430 --> 00:38:51,530
To put meat on the table,

722
00:38:51,544 --> 00:38:53,624
they often go around
shooting birds with slingshots.

723
00:38:54,070 --> 00:38:55,480
Gray turtledoves,

724
00:38:55,670 --> 00:38:57,150
orange parrotbills,

725
00:38:57,440 --> 00:38:58,670
red-crested silver pheasants,

726
00:38:58,840 --> 00:39:00,320
greenish-brown green pigeons,

727
00:39:00,360 --> 00:39:02,648
white-bellied, yellow-necked
pheasant-tailed jacanas,

728
00:39:02,696 --> 00:39:04,150
crested hoopoes,

729
00:39:04,230 --> 00:39:05,670
and even the fairy among birds,

730
00:39:06,440 --> 00:39:08,320
the colorful fairy pitta.

731
00:39:08,590 --> 00:39:10,360
Its crown is fiery red,

732
00:39:10,360 --> 00:39:11,920
and its tail feathers are vivid green,

733
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:13,480
this long,

734
00:39:13,480 --> 00:39:14,590
and absolutely beautiful.

735
00:39:14,880 --> 00:39:16,840
Can you really
shoot such beautiful birds?

736
00:39:17,368 --> 00:39:19,030
If you'd like one, Fourth Young Master,

737
00:39:19,280 --> 00:39:20,360
I'll ask Uncle Liu for help

738
00:39:20,360 --> 00:39:21,660
and have him make you a slingshot.

739
00:39:21,670 --> 00:39:22,830
You'll be able to shoot one.

740
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:23,440
Good.

741
00:39:23,760 --> 00:39:24,800
Have him make one for me.

742
00:39:24,936 --> 00:39:25,840
How much will it cost?

743
00:39:26,670 --> 00:39:27,800
It's only a little trinket.

744
00:39:27,840 --> 00:39:29,840
Consider it a gift
from me, Fourth Young Master.

745
00:39:29,960 --> 00:39:32,550
I only ask that you do me a small favor.

746
00:39:33,070 --> 00:39:35,480
Lanxiang asked me
to take a book to Grandfather.

747
00:39:35,480 --> 00:39:38,280
I didn't think it was a big deal,
so I agreed.

748
00:39:38,824 --> 00:39:40,872
As soon as
Grandfather received the book,

749
00:39:41,320 --> 00:39:43,360
he sent Uncle Geng to fetch Lanxiang

750
00:39:43,400 --> 00:39:46,230
and asked to see
Nanny Wu from Aunt's household.

751
00:39:46,670 --> 00:39:49,230
Then Grandfather
told me to go play on my own.

752
00:39:55,440 --> 00:39:56,230
Jinqi.

753
00:39:57,590 --> 00:39:59,440
Once Lanxiang brings me the slingshot,

754
00:39:59,590 --> 00:40:01,320
I'll shoot a fairy pitta

755
00:40:01,550 --> 00:40:03,150
and use its prettiest tail feathers

756
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:05,000
to make a flower ornament for you.

757
00:40:05,544 --> 00:40:08,070
It'll outshine the ornaments
worn by all the other young men.

758
00:40:11,230 --> 00:40:12,590
Next year on the Festival of Man,

759
00:40:13,070 --> 00:40:14,840
I'll wear the flower ornament
you give me.

760
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:15,800
Good.

761
00:40:21,208 --> 00:40:22,110
Fourth Young Master.

762
00:40:22,440 --> 00:40:24,840
After you finish eating,
I'll take you riding.

763
00:40:25,320 --> 00:40:26,000
I'm full.

764
00:40:26,110 --> 00:40:26,480
Let's go.

765
00:40:26,670 --> 00:40:27,630
Let's go riding.

766
00:40:36,584 --> 00:40:38,616
Thank you
for the Seven Treasure Soup, Jinqi.

767
00:40:38,670 --> 00:40:40,880
Jiugao and I are going riding.

768
00:40:41,360 --> 00:40:41,960
Go ahead.

769
00:40:42,960 --> 00:40:43,630
I'm leaving.

770
00:40:45,590 --> 00:40:47,320
Jiugao, hurry up.

771
00:40:47,590 --> 00:40:48,840
I want to go riding.

772
00:41:19,400 --> 00:41:20,190
Young Master.

773
00:41:22,030 --> 00:41:25,070
Jincen said you'd give him a slingshot

774
00:41:25,480 --> 00:41:27,272
that could hit a bird with every shot.

775
00:41:29,360 --> 00:41:31,630
I was desperate and needed
Fourth Young Master's help,

776
00:41:31,880 --> 00:41:33,000
so I exaggerated.

777
00:41:33,070 --> 00:41:33,920
That was my fault.

778
00:41:34,110 --> 00:41:34,800
But

779
00:41:35,360 --> 00:41:37,710
Uncle Liu really does
make excellent slingshots.

780
00:41:37,832 --> 00:41:39,352
They're very good for shooting birds.

781
00:41:39,432 --> 00:41:41,500
As long as Fourth Young Master
practices diligently,

782
00:41:41,592 --> 00:41:43,160
he'll surely hit his mark every time.

783
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:46,000
How did you know

784
00:41:46,150 --> 00:41:48,400
this book had information
about larkspur?

785
00:41:50,840 --> 00:41:52,960
Yuchan entrusted me
with a box of less important books

786
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:54,310
and asked me to look after them,

787
00:41:54,400 --> 00:41:56,232
so I could learn
how to manage the study.

788
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:58,840
The weather was good today,
so I took the books out to air.

789
00:41:59,190 --> 00:42:00,710
As Yuchan instructed,

790
00:42:01,030 --> 00:42:02,960
I had to carefully leaf
through every book

791
00:42:03,230 --> 00:42:05,030
to check for any damage

792
00:42:05,030 --> 00:42:05,760
or insect holes.

793
00:42:07,000 --> 00:42:08,280
When I was checking this book,

794
00:42:08,510 --> 00:42:10,000
the illustration looked familiar,

795
00:42:10,230 --> 00:42:11,480
so I took a closer look

796
00:42:12,030 --> 00:42:14,800
and realized it was the flower ornament
you were wearing today.

797
00:42:15,976 --> 00:42:17,830
(Larkspur)
Finding the illustration of larkspur

798
00:42:17,840 --> 00:42:18,550
was a coincidence.

799
00:42:19,840 --> 00:42:20,880
But with so little time,

800
00:42:21,016 --> 00:42:23,480
how did you know there were other
larkspur flower ornaments

801
00:42:23,480 --> 00:42:24,960
at Young Lady Du's Luxue Lodge?

802
00:42:26,360 --> 00:42:27,150
Old Master said that

803
00:42:27,208 --> 00:42:29,710
even he hadn't thought
of such a clever solution at the time

804
00:42:29,760 --> 00:42:30,880
to resolve the situation.

805
00:42:33,150 --> 00:42:34,400
Even if we now know

806
00:42:34,630 --> 00:42:36,360
that Cuique
is Young Lady Du's given name,

807
00:42:36,400 --> 00:42:37,550
it's already too late.

808
00:42:38,088 --> 00:42:40,280
Jinqi had already worn
the larkspur flower ornament

809
00:42:40,670 --> 00:42:42,480
in front of everyone.

810
00:42:43,064 --> 00:42:44,480
Young Master's marriage prospects

811
00:42:44,664 --> 00:42:46,280
have already suffered because of Zhao.

812
00:42:47,110 --> 00:42:49,800
If another scandal had broken out today,

813
00:42:50,232 --> 00:42:53,144
Young Master really wouldn't have
been able to find a good match.

814
00:42:55,630 --> 00:42:56,480
Old Master.

815
00:42:57,550 --> 00:42:59,630
What if Young Master wasn't the only one

816
00:42:59,630 --> 00:43:01,030
wearing a larkspur flower ornament?

817
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:07,940
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

818
00:43:09,510 --> 00:43:11,110
The key to buying our freedom

819
00:43:11,110 --> 00:43:12,280
isn't money.

820
00:43:13,070 --> 00:43:14,510
It's First Madam's willingness.

821
00:43:16,030 --> 00:43:17,510
First Madam's willingness?

822
00:43:22,110 --> 00:43:24,030
We can't see it or touch it.

823
00:43:24,510 --> 00:43:25,550
It's not like money

824
00:43:25,800 --> 00:43:26,920
that we can go out and earn.

825
00:43:27,960 --> 00:43:29,150
We can't rush this.

826
00:43:29,576 --> 00:43:31,280
We must plan carefully before we act

827
00:43:31,710 --> 00:43:34,110
and wait for the right moment
to make our move.

828
00:43:35,000 --> 00:43:38,320
When that time comes, the three of us

829
00:43:38,320 --> 00:43:39,800
will surely be freed from servitude

830
00:43:40,110 --> 00:43:41,320
and become commoners.

831
00:43:56,701 --> 00:44:00,821
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

832
00:44:03,661 --> 00:44:08,181
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

833
00:44:09,461 --> 00:44:13,381
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

834
00:44:14,061 --> 00:44:16,821
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

835
00:44:17,541 --> 00:44:19,861
♪Though all the world may fade♪

836
00:44:19,861 --> 00:44:22,941
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

837
00:44:24,461 --> 00:44:28,701
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

838
00:44:31,621 --> 00:44:35,781
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

839
00:44:37,581 --> 00:44:41,141
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

840
00:44:41,141 --> 00:44:44,701
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

841
00:44:45,501 --> 00:44:51,181
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

842
00:44:51,541 --> 00:44:55,861
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

843
00:44:56,221 --> 00:44:59,181
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

844
00:44:59,181 --> 00:45:02,941
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

845
00:45:02,941 --> 00:45:05,821
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

846
00:45:05,821 --> 00:45:09,901
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

847
00:45:09,901 --> 00:45:13,261
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

848
00:45:13,261 --> 00:45:17,021
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

849
